    "Termind does not attach terminal output, chat content, passwords, or private keys to diagnostic data." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Termind fügt Diagnosedaten weder Terminalausgaben noch Chatinhalte, Passwörter oder private Schlüssel hinzu."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Termind does not attach terminal output, chat content, passwords, or private keys to diagnostic data."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Termind ne joint aux données de diagnostic ni sorties de terminal, ni contenu des chats, ni mots de passe, ni clés privées."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Termindは、診断データにターミナル出力、チャット内容、パスワード、秘密鍵を含めません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Termind는 진단 데이터에 터미널 출력, 채팅 내용, 암호 또는 개인 키를 포함하지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Termind不会在诊断数据中附加终端输出、聊天内容、密码或私钥。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Termind不會在診斷資料中附加終端輸出、聊天內容、密碼或私鑰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Termind returns only a one-shot handle to the MCP client. The value is bound to this session, destination, ssh_exec, and purpose." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Termind gibt dem MCP-Client nur eine einmalig verwendbare Kennung zurück. Der Wert ist an diese Sitzung, das Ziel, ssh_exec und den Zweck gebunden."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Termind renvoie uniquement un identifiant à usage unique au client MCP. La valeur est liée à cette session, à la destination, à ssh_exec et à l’usage prévu."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TermindはMCPクライアントに一度限りのハンドルのみを返します。値は、このセッション、接続先、ssh_exec、用途に紐付けられます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Termind는 MCP 클라이언트에 일회용 핸들만 반환합니다. 이 값은 현재 세션, 대상, ssh_exec 및 용도에 연결됩니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Termind只向MCP客户端返回一次性句柄。该值绑定到当前会话、目标、ssh_exec和用途。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Termind只向MCP使用者端返回一次性控制代碼。該值繫結到目前工作階段、目標、ssh_exec和用途。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Termind uses [Ghostty](https://ghostty.org) as its terminal engine. Custom configuration uses [Ghostty's configuration format](https://ghostty.org/docs/config/reference)." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Termind verwendet [Ghostty](https://ghostty.org) als Terminal-Engine. Die benutzerdefinierte Konfiguration verwendet das [Konfigurationsformat von Ghostty](https://ghostty.org/docs/config/reference)."
